== Research Interests

- Dissipativity-based decentralized stability criteria for converter-dominated power systems.
- Coordinated planning of active distribution networks with distributed energy resources.
- Electric-vehicle charging infrastructure in urban and low-carbon distribution networks.

== Recent News

- 2026-05-06 — Completed the probationary review for the Ph.D. program at The University of Hong Kong.
- 2026-01-19 — Received the Best Paper Award at the 2026 IEEE PES International Meeting.
- 2024-06-28 — Master's thesis selected as an Outstanding Thesis at Tsinghua University (Top 5%).
- 2024-06-24 — Graduated from Tsinghua University as an Outstanding Master's Graduate (Top 2%).
- 2023-10-11 — Received the First-Class Scholarship at Tsinghua University (Top 5%).

== Mottos
- /Impasse precedes epiphany./  

